ComputationPlan.description:
The result of planning a computation without executing it.

Pixels are the budget currency because they are what actually costs money;
limits on geometry count, time range, and scene count are proxies for it.

OutputFormat.description:
Persisted output format. Delta is required for a OneLake Tables shortcut;
bare GeoParquet can only land in Files and still requires the customer to
write the notebook this feature exists to eliminate.
